POWER BI MAP CONTEXT
  The Shape Map in powerbi/ draws census tract boundaries round the parcels, with water cut out: US Census Bureau,
  TIGERweb (Census Tracts and Areal Hydrography), public domain, generalised and cut to the map frame. Water itself is
  the map background showing where no land is drawn.

